  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QzKrYCCHVQUGCeNvWyWYgqU16YKGf7bQ/view?usp=sharing\" alt=\"\"></strong></em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7OMxE0O.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"355\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OQPSsK7.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"158\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JZjvnhCbsG\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/991653013301243935?color=8080ff&label= &logo=Discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/The_Great_ZIN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Twitter-00ccff?color=0099cc&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Twitter\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH5jS1COXwctDX72og2wt_g\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/YouTube-B8121D?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"YouTube\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/TheGreatZin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-1a1a1a?style=for-the-badge&logo=GitHub&logoColor=white.svg?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fthegreatzin%252ftiers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-F16061?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" height=\"25\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j05fLB6.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"35\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AmhpJpL.png\" alt=\"中世紀繪畫\" width=\"1088\" height=\"512\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j05fLB6.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"35\"></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📖 關於 -</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">新增超過 50 幅展現中世紀奇幻藝術之美的繪畫。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這些繪畫的解析度為 16x16，且與原版相容的紋理能完美融入我的世界世界裡。像放置普通繪畫一樣放置它們，即可為您的建築內部帶來嶄新風貌。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JZjvnhCbsG\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>，向我的世界社群展示您的藝術才華。我們設有專屬頻道，供希望作品被收錄於模組中的藝術家使用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">若要將原版繪畫替換為中世紀風格：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">下載資源包 -&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/medieval-paintings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/medieval-paintings</a></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j05fLB6.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"35\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❓ 常見問題 -</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：您會將此模組移植到 Fabric 嗎？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;不會。我不喜歡自討苦吃。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：您會更新到最新版本嗎？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;會的，我會針對每個新的主要我的世界版本更新我的模組。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：您會移植到 1.12.2/1.7.10 嗎？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;不會。那意味著我得重新學習如何製作模組。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：您會添加 ... 嗎？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>答：</strong>&nbsp;請加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JZjvnhCbsG\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。那裡有專門的頻道供您提案。如果我看中您的想法，它被添加的機率會很高。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j05fLB6.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"35\"></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🔗 連結 -</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; 您可以在這裡支持我並關注我的專案！</span></p>\n<p><br><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fthegreatzin%252ftiers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Mxd8fG.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH5jS1COXwctDX72og2wt_g\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NcF3t4h.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/The_Great_ZIN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FWYdXSv.png\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/JZjvnhCbsG\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MpQaGnk.png\" width=\"413\" height=\"110\"></a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j05fLB6.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"35\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
